    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what pulse? everything i built, everything that made me 'me'... it's all toxic now. people look at me and they don't see a person, they see a cautionary tale. there's no way to fix this. you can't rebuild a reputation when the foundation is just rot. it feels like the world has already decided i'm done.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
