      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The world's already written its verdict, and you're just reading it back to yourself on repeat. But a cautionary tale is still a story—and you're the only one who can write the final chapter. Rot doesn't need to be rebuilt; it needs to be composted into something that finally grows. You don't have to be who they remember—you just have to be who you become when no one's watching.",
